1
00:01:27,105 --> 00:01:31,025
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:34,105 --> 00:01:35,145
Father.

3
00:01:36,145 --> 00:01:37,545
I have loved Zhili for a long time.

4
00:01:39,625 --> 00:01:41,185
In my heart, Zhili

5
00:01:41,265 --> 00:01:42,105
is more precious than any treasure.

6
00:01:43,305 --> 00:01:45,265
I cannot bear anyone speaking ill of her.

7
00:01:46,345 --> 00:01:47,185
I am establishing my own household

8
00:01:47,265 --> 00:01:48,945
because I want to give her the very best.

9
00:01:49,025 --> 00:01:50,465
I know

10
00:01:51,185 --> 00:01:53,065
this is still not enough
to prove my sincerity.

11
00:01:53,905 --> 00:01:54,745
So

12
00:01:55,225 --> 00:01:57,425
I am willing to accept any test
Father and Mother set for me.

13
00:02:03,745 --> 00:02:04,585
Anian.

14
00:02:06,465 --> 00:02:08,145
I have watched you grow up.

15
00:02:08,865 --> 00:02:11,105
You have always been
brave and disciplined.

16
00:02:12,105 --> 00:02:13,105
Though you are young,

17
00:02:13,665 --> 00:02:15,425
you have always been

18
00:02:15,945 --> 00:02:17,345
steady in word and deed.

19
00:02:23,225 --> 00:02:24,065
However,

20
00:02:25,065 --> 00:02:26,345
as for Zhili's marriage,

21
00:02:27,345 --> 00:02:28,985
we will never force her.

22
00:02:29,585 --> 00:02:30,745
Zhili herself

23
00:02:31,305 --> 00:02:32,345
will make the decision.

24
00:02:37,185 --> 00:02:38,025
Zhili.

25
00:02:39,745 --> 00:02:40,785
Will you marry me?

26
00:02:45,505 --> 00:02:47,265
The Shen family has fallen on hard times.

27
00:02:47,345 --> 00:02:48,705
How can I think of marrying now?

28
00:02:52,265 --> 00:02:53,105
Don't worry.

29
00:02:53,625 --> 00:02:54,785
As long as I, Di Nian, am here,

30
00:02:55,345 --> 00:02:57,345
I will never let anyone
slight the Shen family again.

31
00:02:58,225 --> 00:02:59,865
I can ask His Majesty to
grant us a marriage decree

32
00:03:00,385 --> 00:03:01,465
so you can marry with full honor

33
00:03:01,545 --> 00:03:03,345
and enter the Di household
proudly and openly.

34
00:03:06,505 --> 00:03:07,465
You truly

35
00:03:09,185 --> 00:03:10,545
don't care about what happened to me?

36
00:03:11,185 --> 00:03:12,265
I don't.

37
00:03:13,265 --> 00:03:14,385
Then do you understand

38
00:03:15,025 --> 00:03:16,465
that what weighs on my heart

39
00:03:16,545 --> 00:03:18,905
the knot in my heart won't come undone
just because you say you don't care.

40
00:03:18,985 --> 00:03:20,505
Even if I marry you,

41
00:03:21,465 --> 00:03:23,305
I will not love you.

42
00:03:23,385 --> 00:03:25,145
I will never force your feelings.

43
00:03:25,225 --> 00:03:27,625
I know this proposal is sudden,

44
00:03:28,545 --> 00:03:30,985
but I also wish to preserve
the Shen family's honor.

45
00:03:31,065 --> 00:03:33,185
I have no intention of taking
advantage of your vulnerability.

46
00:03:34,785 --> 00:03:36,105
If one day

47
00:03:36,185 --> 00:03:37,465
your heart belongs to someone else,

48
00:03:39,385 --> 00:03:40,385
I will not stand in your way.

49
00:03:43,025 --> 00:03:44,305
Trust me.

50
00:03:44,385 --> 00:03:47,025
I won't let anyone mistreat you
or make you suffer.

51
00:03:47,585 --> 00:03:48,985
Not for the rest of your life.

52
00:03:54,945 --> 00:03:55,785
Zhili.

53
00:03:56,505 --> 00:03:58,465
I understand your concerns.

54
00:03:58,545 --> 00:04:00,865
You deserve every good
thing in this world.

55
00:04:01,905 --> 00:04:03,145
Whatever you choose,

56
00:04:03,865 --> 00:04:05,665
the Shen family's spirit will not break.

57
00:04:23,585 --> 00:04:24,425
Anian.

58
00:04:26,865 --> 00:04:27,705
I trust you.

59
00:04:29,385 --> 00:04:30,585
I am willing to marry you.

60
00:05:07,665 --> 00:05:08,505
Don't worry.

61
00:05:09,105 --> 00:05:11,225
Whatever lies ahead,
we are all here for you.

62
00:05:59,785 --> 00:06:01,345
Grand Tutor, Madam.

63
00:06:01,425 --> 00:06:02,585
Everything outside is ready.

64
00:06:03,465 --> 00:06:04,305
It's all ready.

65
00:06:04,385 --> 00:06:05,225
Ready.

66
00:06:11,745 --> 00:06:14,265
Xiaolin, light them.

67
00:06:28,105 --> 00:06:28,945
Beautiful.

68
00:07:06,545 --> 00:07:08,025
So beautiful.

69
00:07:08,105 --> 00:07:09,065
This one is lovely.

70
00:07:16,425 --> 00:07:17,865
Don't worry.

71
00:07:17,945 --> 00:07:20,225
Di Nian would pluck the stars and moon
for Zhili,

72
00:07:21,225 --> 00:07:23,105
yet he can also give her
all the freedom in the world.

73
00:07:23,185 --> 00:07:25,225
Perhaps that, too, is a gift.

74
00:07:26,265 --> 00:07:27,825
By the time they marry,

75
00:07:28,865 --> 00:07:30,945
Fuzhi and Young Lord Shen
should be back as well.

76
00:07:31,025 --> 00:07:33,305
Now both the Tiger's Roar Gang
and those who shielded it

77
00:07:34,025 --> 00:07:35,105
have been eliminated.

78
00:07:36,105 --> 00:07:37,545
Congratulations are also
due to Director Meng

79
00:07:38,465 --> 00:07:39,545
for getting what you wished for.

80
00:07:40,105 --> 00:07:41,065
What I wished for

81
00:07:41,665 --> 00:07:42,985
is also what Your Majesty wanted.

82
00:07:44,265 --> 00:07:45,745
If congratulations are in order,

83
00:07:46,505 --> 00:07:48,505
then I should be
congratulating Your Majesty.

84
00:07:51,585 --> 00:07:52,945
I remember you once said

85
00:07:53,545 --> 00:07:55,105
the first snow is a time to make a wish.

86
00:07:55,625 --> 00:07:57,425
Director Meng has earned
another great merit.

87
00:07:57,905 --> 00:08:00,145
Tell me what you want.

88
00:08:05,105 --> 00:08:06,385
Your Majesty already knows.

89
00:08:12,985 --> 00:08:14,265
What I wish for

90
00:08:15,265 --> 00:08:16,865
has always been to serve at court.

91
00:08:18,385 --> 00:08:20,185
Not a single wish concerning me?

92
00:08:24,265 --> 00:08:25,385
I believe

93
00:08:26,345 --> 00:08:27,985
walking side by side,
lighting each other's way,

94
00:08:29,105 --> 00:08:30,545
would make this life worthwhile.

95
00:08:30,625 --> 00:08:32,105
I do not want to make things
difficult for Your Majesty,

96
00:08:34,345 --> 00:08:35,825
nor do I wish to ask for more.

97
00:08:35,905 --> 00:08:38,425
Then let me be greedy on your behalf.

98
00:08:40,265 --> 00:08:41,665
I want you to have real authority

99
00:08:42,425 --> 00:08:43,705
and true love.

100
00:08:45,385 --> 00:08:46,225
These dragon-and-phoenix pendants

101
00:08:46,305 --> 00:08:48,665
were with my father and mother
for over thirty years.

102
00:08:48,745 --> 00:08:50,785
The dragon is for the Emperor;
the phoenix, the Empress.

103
00:08:51,785 --> 00:08:52,625
Today,

104
00:08:53,505 --> 00:08:55,185
with the snow of Western Hills as witness,

105
00:08:56,305 --> 00:08:57,385
I give the phoenix pendant to you.

106
00:08:58,105 --> 00:08:58,985
I know

107
00:08:59,065 --> 00:09:00,945
you do not seek the position of Empress,

108
00:09:01,025 --> 00:09:03,065
nor do you wish to be
confined to the inner palace.

109
00:09:04,745 --> 00:09:06,705
But this is my promise to you.

110
00:09:07,865 --> 00:09:09,185
I trust Your Majesty completely.

111
00:09:10,705 --> 00:09:11,825
But ancestral law will not allow it.

112
00:09:12,705 --> 00:09:16,225
I would rather be your blade or sword,

113
00:09:16,305 --> 00:09:17,225
a minister who speaks truth to you,

114
00:09:18,545 --> 00:09:20,745
so Your Majesty's good name endures.

115
00:09:20,825 --> 00:09:23,425
Ancestral laws are fixed.
People are not.

116
00:09:24,745 --> 00:09:26,905
I am reforming the administration
and restoring order at court

117
00:09:27,585 --> 00:09:29,505
because I refuse to bow to outdated rules.

118
00:09:29,585 --> 00:09:31,185
A position of real authority—

119
00:09:31,265 --> 00:09:32,105
I will give you that.

120
00:09:32,825 --> 00:09:34,625
A life without regret—I
will share it with you.

121
00:09:34,705 --> 00:09:37,265
These have never been mutually exclusive.

122
00:09:38,185 --> 00:09:39,425
The weight of this realm

123
00:09:40,065 --> 00:09:42,025
I am willing to bear with you.

124
00:09:42,105 --> 00:09:43,625
I am willing to stand with Your Majesty

125
00:09:46,225 --> 00:09:47,345
to secure the realm,

126
00:09:49,105 --> 00:09:50,185
care for the people,

127
00:09:52,065 --> 00:09:53,505
and bring lasting peace.

128
00:11:06,185 --> 00:11:08,505
First, bow to Heaven and Earth.

129
00:11:13,665 --> 00:11:16,225
Second, bow to your parents.

130
00:11:24,105 --> 00:11:26,145
Husband and wife, bow to each other.

131
00:11:36,585 --> 00:11:39,585
Perform the joined-cup rite.

132
00:11:44,025 --> 00:11:46,505
Drink the joined-cup wine together.

133
00:11:46,585 --> 00:11:48,985
May husband and wife grow old together.

134
00:11:58,785 --> 00:12:02,585
-Congratulations!
-Congratulations!

135
00:12:07,225 --> 00:12:08,065
Wonderful.

136
00:12:26,905 --> 00:12:27,745
Madam.

137
00:12:27,825 --> 00:12:29,745
The Marquis has dismissed the guests.

138
00:12:29,825 --> 00:12:31,265
He said you were tired today

139
00:12:31,345 --> 00:12:33,865
and should rest peacefully
in the inner room.

140
00:12:33,945 --> 00:12:35,545
He will sleep on the couch outside tonight

141
00:12:35,625 --> 00:12:37,105
so as not to disturb you.

142
00:13:14,825 --> 00:13:16,065
Zhili.

143
00:13:20,065 --> 00:13:21,345
Why are you still awake so late?

144
00:13:21,425 --> 00:13:22,465
Is something wrong?

145
00:13:23,065 --> 00:13:24,425
Now that we are married,

146
00:13:25,305 --> 00:13:26,465
if we sleep in separate rooms

147
00:13:27,185 --> 00:13:28,865
and word reaches the court,

148
00:13:28,945 --> 00:13:30,265
what will people say?

149
00:13:30,345 --> 00:13:32,145
I'd like to see who dares
call our marriage false.

150
00:13:33,465 --> 00:13:34,665
Don't worry.

151
00:13:34,745 --> 00:13:35,665
With me here,

152
00:13:35,745 --> 00:13:36,905
no one will dare bully you.

153
00:13:36,985 --> 00:13:38,305
From now on,

154
00:13:38,385 --> 00:13:40,265
we can live just as we
did at the Shen residence.

155
00:13:41,305 --> 00:13:42,385
Go get some sleep.

156
00:13:43,425 --> 00:13:45,185
You preserved the Shen family's honor.

157
00:13:46,225 --> 00:13:47,505
I also do not want

158
00:13:47,585 --> 00:13:49,305
my troubles to tarnish your reputation.

159
00:13:50,545 --> 00:13:52,025
Your standing in the army

160
00:13:52,105 --> 00:13:53,665
must not suffer in the slightest.

161
00:13:54,425 --> 00:13:57,545
Especially now that you've
inherited the marquisate.

162
00:13:58,425 --> 00:13:59,505
Since I have married you,

163
00:14:00,585 --> 00:14:02,265
I understand what this marriage entails.

164
00:14:03,385 --> 00:14:04,225
Whatever happens,

165
00:14:05,345 --> 00:14:07,065
I do not want you to suffer any wrong.

166
00:14:11,825 --> 00:14:13,465
From this day forward,

167
00:14:15,985 --> 00:14:17,225
you, Di Nian,

168
00:14:17,305 --> 00:14:18,985
are my husband.

169
00:14:19,585 --> 00:14:21,945
And the Di residence is now my home.

170
00:14:22,865 --> 00:14:24,185
You treat me well,

171
00:14:25,705 --> 00:14:27,065
and I will treat you well in return.

172
00:14:27,665 --> 00:14:28,865
Zhili.

173
00:14:28,945 --> 00:14:30,185
Though we are married,

174
00:14:30,665 --> 00:14:31,785
I will respect you.

175
00:14:32,385 --> 00:14:33,345
I will wait until

176
00:14:33,865 --> 00:14:35,145
you truly come to love me.

177
00:14:38,785 --> 00:14:40,185
You look lovely when you smile.

178
00:15:31,785 --> 00:15:32,625
Zhili.

179
00:15:33,465 --> 00:15:35,505
You sleep here. I will take the couch.

180
00:15:36,625 --> 00:15:38,665
Call me anytime if you
need anything tonight.

181
00:16:08,225 --> 00:16:09,065
Director Meng.

182
00:16:13,825 --> 00:16:14,665
The wind is strong today.

183
00:16:15,465 --> 00:16:16,305
Put this on.

184
00:16:16,385 --> 00:16:17,465
Don't catch a chill.

185
00:16:22,625 --> 00:16:23,945
I can do it myself.

186
00:16:24,025 --> 00:16:25,385
Let me.

187
00:16:25,465 --> 00:16:26,985
You still have much to do.

188
00:16:27,065 --> 00:16:27,905
Go attend to your work.

189
00:16:27,985 --> 00:16:28,945
Don't worry.

190
00:16:29,665 --> 00:16:30,665
Everything you entrusted to me,

191
00:16:30,745 --> 00:16:32,065
I have seen to without missing a thing.

192
00:16:36,105 --> 00:16:37,105
There.

193
00:16:37,945 --> 00:16:38,785
I'm off.

194
00:16:54,265 --> 00:16:56,865
In Daning's third year of Jingyuan,

195
00:16:56,945 --> 00:16:58,825
at the Grand Imperial Sacrifice,

196
00:16:58,905 --> 00:17:00,465
may Heaven grant its protection

197
00:17:00,545 --> 00:17:02,505
and bless all the people.

198
00:17:02,585 --> 00:17:04,185
By the Sacred Ancestor's teachings,

199
00:17:04,265 --> 00:17:06,065
our great foundation was established.

200
00:17:06,145 --> 00:17:08,745
Today, His Majesty reverently
presents the ritual vessels

201
00:17:08,825 --> 00:17:10,985
and bows before the ancestral temple.

202
00:17:11,065 --> 00:17:12,025
Leading all civil and military officials,

203
00:17:12,105 --> 00:17:14,065
he respectfully performs the grand rite.

204
00:17:14,145 --> 00:17:16,545
May our ancestors graciously
accept these offerings.

205
00:17:29,585 --> 00:17:31,345
Kneel and bow.

206
00:17:36,545 --> 00:17:38,105
Bow again.

207
00:17:41,465 --> 00:17:43,185
Bow a third time.

208
00:18:03,065 --> 00:18:05,145
Today is the grand ancestral ceremony.

209
00:18:05,705 --> 00:18:07,345
Before our revered ancestors,

210
00:18:07,425 --> 00:18:10,745
I personally proclaim an edict of reform.

211
00:18:11,305 --> 00:18:12,625
At the founding of the dynasty,

212
00:18:12,705 --> 00:18:15,385
the late Emperor established
twelve ancestral laws.

213
00:18:15,985 --> 00:18:17,425
They have endured through three reigns.

214
00:18:17,505 --> 00:18:18,945
But times have changed.

215
00:18:19,025 --> 00:18:20,065
Among them,

216
00:18:20,785 --> 00:18:22,705
the ban on sovereign-subject romance,

217
00:18:22,785 --> 00:18:24,185
permanent slave status,

218
00:18:24,265 --> 00:18:26,105
and the ministers'
nomination of the Empress—

219
00:18:26,185 --> 00:18:27,225
these three laws

220
00:18:27,305 --> 00:18:28,985
are no longer suited to our time.

221
00:18:29,065 --> 00:18:31,825
As for the ministers'
nomination of the Empress,

222
00:18:31,905 --> 00:18:34,745
it was meant to balance
sovereign and ministers,

223
00:18:34,825 --> 00:18:36,865
yet treacherous men nearly exploited it

224
00:18:36,945 --> 00:18:37,985
and brought disaster upon the state.

225
00:18:39,465 --> 00:18:40,825
I have considered this repeatedly.

226
00:18:41,545 --> 00:18:44,105
Any entrenched old law
that harms the realm

227
00:18:45,225 --> 00:18:47,585
must be uprooted completely.

228
00:18:47,665 --> 00:18:48,505
Your Majesty.

229
00:18:48,585 --> 00:18:50,385
Since the late Emperor
established these ancestral laws,

230
00:18:50,945 --> 00:18:52,665
no one has altered them
for three generations.

231
00:18:52,745 --> 00:18:54,585
If Your Majesty abolishes them rashly,

232
00:18:54,665 --> 00:18:56,545
what place does that
leave for our ancestors

233
00:18:57,305 --> 00:18:59,265
or the rules and rites of the palace?

234
00:18:59,345 --> 00:19:00,785
Without breaking the old,
the new cannot stand.

235
00:19:01,625 --> 00:19:04,505
To follow old precedent in everything

236
00:19:04,585 --> 00:19:06,705
would truly betray our ancestors' intent.

237
00:19:07,905 --> 00:19:09,305
Your Majesty, please consider.

238
00:19:09,385 --> 00:19:10,865
Zhongwan's remnants are still lying low.

239
00:19:10,945 --> 00:19:11,825
If we reform now,

240
00:19:11,905 --> 00:19:13,585
the court will surely fall into turmoil.

241
00:19:13,665 --> 00:19:14,945
If foreign enemies exploit our weakness,
I fear...

242
00:19:15,025 --> 00:19:17,705
Without turmoil within,
why fear threats without?

243
00:19:18,545 --> 00:19:20,505
If the entire court stands united,

244
00:19:20,585 --> 00:19:22,145
even surrounded by powerful enemies,

245
00:19:22,225 --> 00:19:24,065
what has Daning to fear?

246
00:19:25,545 --> 00:19:27,225
There is no need to debate this further.

247
00:19:27,305 --> 00:19:28,545
My decision is final.

248
00:19:49,785 --> 00:19:50,785
This...

249
00:19:50,865 --> 00:19:53,025
This is the phoenix pendant
the late Emperor gave the late Empress.

250
00:19:53,105 --> 00:19:54,225
It was the imperial couple's token.

251
00:19:54,305 --> 00:19:56,745
Your Majesty is not yet married.
Such an important token—

252
00:19:56,825 --> 00:19:58,185
how can a mere court official possess it?

253
00:19:58,265 --> 00:19:59,865
How dare you, Meng Tinghui!

254
00:19:59,945 --> 00:20:02,425
You covet the Empress's seat!

255
00:20:02,985 --> 00:20:05,105
During the top metropolitan scholar
impostor case,

256
00:20:06,025 --> 00:20:08,545
I already suspected your
motives were impure.

257
00:20:08,625 --> 00:20:10,505
You pretend your ambition
lies in government,

258
00:20:10,585 --> 00:20:12,705
but in truth you seek His Majesty's favor

259
00:20:12,785 --> 00:20:13,945
to seize the Empress's throne.

260
00:20:14,025 --> 00:20:15,465
Thinking back now,

261
00:20:15,545 --> 00:20:18,185
when she attacked the Right Chancellor
and schemed against the Shen family,

262
00:20:18,265 --> 00:20:20,025
ruining Miss Shen's reputation,

263
00:20:20,105 --> 00:20:22,385
was that also to clear her
own path to becoming Empress?

264
00:20:22,465 --> 00:20:23,905
That accusation is utterly unfair.

265
00:20:23,985 --> 00:20:25,345
If not for Director Meng,

266
00:20:25,425 --> 00:20:27,705
how could Ling Yunfei and
the Tiger's Roar Gang,

267
00:20:27,785 --> 00:20:30,225
even the traitor Gu Qin
hidden within the court,

268
00:20:30,305 --> 00:20:32,105
have been brought to justice so quickly?

269
00:20:32,185 --> 00:20:33,545
Stop changing the subject.

270
00:20:33,625 --> 00:20:35,025
Why is the phoenix pendant in her hands?

271
00:20:35,105 --> 00:20:36,745
I gave it to her.

272
00:20:42,305 --> 00:20:43,545
As for this phoenix pendant,

273
00:20:44,425 --> 00:20:47,225
I personally gave it to Meng Tinghui.

274
00:20:47,305 --> 00:20:48,945
Romance between sovereign and subject

275
00:20:49,025 --> 00:20:50,145
is a crime the moment it begins.

276
00:20:50,225 --> 00:20:52,105
Your Majesty's words mean that...

277
00:20:52,185 --> 00:20:53,025
Correct.

278
00:20:53,985 --> 00:20:55,865
I love Meng Tinghui.

279
00:20:56,945 --> 00:21:00,105
I have decided to
abolish that prohibition.

280
00:21:00,185 --> 00:21:01,385
Your Majesty says

281
00:21:01,465 --> 00:21:04,305
three obsolete ancestral
laws will be abolished,

282
00:21:05,625 --> 00:21:08,185
but perhaps you only
mean to abolish this one

283
00:21:09,865 --> 00:21:11,265
so you can place Meng Tinghui

284
00:21:11,345 --> 00:21:13,425
on the Empress's throne.

285
00:21:14,305 --> 00:21:16,465
That witch has bewitched Your Majesty!

286
00:21:18,545 --> 00:21:20,145
Under ancestral law,

287
00:21:20,225 --> 00:21:22,145
she should be executed by a thousand cuts.

288
00:21:22,225 --> 00:21:23,545
Daning's legal code contains 360 statutes,

289
00:21:23,625 --> 00:21:25,025
and no such crime exists among them.

290
00:21:25,105 --> 00:21:25,945
Your Majesty...

291
00:21:26,025 --> 00:21:27,665
So-called ancestral law,

292
00:21:27,745 --> 00:21:29,505
when it no longer suits the age,

293
00:21:30,345 --> 00:21:31,625
must be reformed.

294
00:21:34,865 --> 00:21:37,705
Today Your Majesty breaks one law for her.

295
00:21:37,785 --> 00:21:39,945
Tomorrow you may abolish a hundred more.

296
00:21:40,025 --> 00:21:41,345
If this continues,

297
00:21:41,425 --> 00:21:42,905
the court

298
00:21:42,985 --> 00:21:45,905
will answer only
to you and Meng Tinghui.

299
00:21:45,985 --> 00:21:48,385
Then what use are ministers like us?

300
00:21:48,465 --> 00:21:50,385
What is wrong with reform?

301
00:21:50,465 --> 00:21:51,905
Everything I have done

302
00:21:51,985 --> 00:21:54,225
is not for Meng Tinghui alone.

303
00:21:54,305 --> 00:21:56,465
But her presence

304
00:21:56,545 --> 00:21:58,585
has strengthened my resolve to reform

305
00:21:58,665 --> 00:21:59,825
and made me act more swiftly.

306
00:21:59,905 --> 00:22:02,225
Your Majesty may have a thousand reasons,

307
00:22:03,385 --> 00:22:05,225
but in the eyes of the people,

308
00:22:06,185 --> 00:22:08,985
you have merely been
bewitched by this demoness.

309
00:22:09,065 --> 00:22:11,665
Do you not fear losing
the people's support

310
00:22:11,745 --> 00:22:13,545
and being condemned as a foolish ruler?

311
00:22:13,625 --> 00:22:14,825
This realm is mine.

312
00:22:16,465 --> 00:22:18,265
I will bear its burden myself.

313
00:22:27,905 --> 00:22:30,225
I have already issued
an Edict of Self-Reproach.

314
00:22:30,305 --> 00:22:31,745
I will proclaim to the world

315
00:22:32,985 --> 00:22:33,905
that my reforms—

316
00:22:33,985 --> 00:22:35,385
their rights and wrongs,
merits and faults—

317
00:22:35,945 --> 00:22:37,865
may be judged by future generations.

318
00:22:41,265 --> 00:22:43,305
An Edict of Self-Reproach?

319
00:22:43,825 --> 00:22:45,265
Your Majesty.

320
00:22:46,465 --> 00:22:48,705
Meng Tinghui, though a woman,

321
00:22:49,305 --> 00:22:51,185
holds the power of state oversight.

322
00:22:51,265 --> 00:22:53,225
That alone violates ancestral law.

323
00:22:54,905 --> 00:22:56,945
And now, with Your Majesty...

324
00:22:59,505 --> 00:23:01,745
This is an omen of disaster for the state.

325
00:23:02,945 --> 00:23:05,865
The late Emperor granted me
this Dragon-Headed Staff,

326
00:23:05,945 --> 00:23:07,745
to strike a foolish ruler above

327
00:23:08,585 --> 00:23:09,985
and corrupt ministers below.

328
00:23:11,985 --> 00:23:14,625
Before our ancestors today,

329
00:23:15,585 --> 00:23:16,705
on behalf of the late Emperor,

330
00:23:18,265 --> 00:23:20,505
I will discipline Your Majesty.

331
00:23:22,825 --> 00:23:25,025
A baleful star has descended,

332
00:23:25,105 --> 00:23:26,105
throwing the court into chaos.

333
00:23:26,185 --> 00:23:28,585
Today I will restore order

334
00:23:29,065 --> 00:23:30,145
and purge the evil beside the throne.

335
00:23:33,905 --> 00:23:35,385
-This...
-Left Chancellor...

336
00:23:40,385 --> 00:23:42,145
Left Chancellor.

337
00:23:42,705 --> 00:23:44,305
I tolerate this one blow

338
00:23:46,105 --> 00:23:49,105
because you have served three reigns.

339
00:24:19,625 --> 00:24:20,945
Late Emperor...

340
00:24:23,545 --> 00:24:26,025
The duty you entrusted
to this old minister

341
00:24:27,425 --> 00:24:29,665
I have failed to fulfill.

342
00:24:31,425 --> 00:24:33,345
Please rest assured,

343
00:24:34,505 --> 00:24:37,065
even if it costs me my life,

344
00:24:38,105 --> 00:24:41,345
I will not let His
Majesty persist in error

345
00:24:42,145 --> 00:24:44,265
and bear the infamy of a foolish ruler.

346
00:24:48,945 --> 00:24:51,385
-Chancellor!
-Chancellor!

347
00:24:53,145 --> 00:24:54,945
-Chancellor!
-Chancellor!

348
00:24:55,025 --> 00:24:56,145
Chancellor!

349
00:24:56,225 --> 00:24:57,665
-Chancellor!
-Chancellor!

350
00:25:00,385 --> 00:25:02,705
Attendants! Summon an imperial physician!

351
00:25:02,785 --> 00:25:03,705
Wait.

352
00:25:04,825 --> 00:25:05,865
Your Majesty.

353
00:25:06,945 --> 00:25:09,705
Unless you withdraw
the Edict of Self-Reproach

354
00:25:10,185 --> 00:25:12,185
and execute that witch,

355
00:25:12,945 --> 00:25:13,985
I would rather

356
00:25:14,545 --> 00:25:17,985
die here in this hall.

357
00:25:18,065 --> 00:25:19,345
Left Chancellor,

358
00:25:19,425 --> 00:25:21,225
you cannot die!

359
00:25:21,305 --> 00:25:22,985
If anyone must die,
let this old servant die!

360
00:25:23,065 --> 00:25:26,505
I am the one who has failed our ancestors!

361
00:25:28,345 --> 00:25:29,505
Your Majesty.

362
00:25:29,585 --> 00:25:31,745
Daning's foundation was hard won.

363
00:25:31,825 --> 00:25:34,265
Please heed the Left Chancellor

364
00:25:34,345 --> 00:25:37,065
and withdraw the Edict of Self-Reproach.

365
00:25:39,025 --> 00:25:42,625
Please withdraw the
Edict of Self-Reproach!

366
00:25:42,705 --> 00:25:45,425
Please withdraw the
Edict of Self-Reproach!

367
00:25:47,825 --> 00:25:50,905
Please withdraw the
Edict of Self-Reproach!

368
00:25:50,985 --> 00:25:53,305
Execute Meng Tinghui by a thousand cuts!

369
00:25:53,385 --> 00:25:55,945
Please withdraw the
Edict of Self-Reproach!

370
00:25:56,025 --> 00:25:58,585
Execute Meng Tinghui by a thousand cuts!

371
00:26:03,305 --> 00:26:04,345
Your Majesty.

372
00:26:05,025 --> 00:26:06,465
I admit my guilt.

373
00:26:13,465 --> 00:26:14,865
I ask to be imprisoned.

374
00:26:16,665 --> 00:26:18,025
I submit to any punishment.

375
00:26:30,345 --> 00:26:31,225
Meng Tinghui.

376
00:26:35,025 --> 00:26:36,145
I have no regrets.

377
00:26:38,545 --> 00:26:40,665
But if because of me, Your Majesty

378
00:26:41,825 --> 00:26:43,265
drives a veteran of three
reigns to his death,

379
00:26:44,945 --> 00:26:47,185
even ten thousand deaths
could not atone for my guilt.

380
00:26:50,265 --> 00:26:53,025
I beg Your Majesty to put the realm first.

381
00:27:39,465 --> 00:27:41,305
Director Meng, this drug
will make you appear dead.

382
00:27:41,385 --> 00:27:43,625
For twenty-four hours after you take it,

383
00:27:43,705 --> 00:27:45,505
you will have neither breath nor pulse.

384
00:27:45,585 --> 00:27:46,665
Even an imperial physician
will not be able to tell.

385
00:27:49,345 --> 00:27:50,745
What are you doing?

386
00:27:50,825 --> 00:27:51,665
Getting you out of here.

387
00:27:51,745 --> 00:27:53,385
I will not leave.

388
00:27:54,185 --> 00:27:55,105
In the great hall,

389
00:27:55,665 --> 00:27:57,065
the ministers were enraged.

390
00:27:57,145 --> 00:27:58,425
That is why I asked to be imprisoned.

391
00:27:59,745 --> 00:28:00,865
Besides,

392
00:28:00,945 --> 00:28:02,705
this gold chain broke suspiciously.

393
00:28:06,625 --> 00:28:08,425
You were only bewitched for a moment

394
00:28:08,905 --> 00:28:09,985
and lost your judgment.

395
00:28:10,585 --> 00:28:13,145
So I used this gold-softening agent
to give you a push.

396
00:28:13,945 --> 00:28:14,825
Two hours from now,

397
00:28:14,905 --> 00:28:16,025
when incense is burned for the ancestors,

398
00:28:17,265 --> 00:28:19,465
the gold will give way
and the chain will snap.

399
00:28:22,385 --> 00:28:23,225
Do you regret it?

400
00:28:26,265 --> 00:28:28,185
Do you truly believe he will

401
00:28:28,265 --> 00:28:29,305
make an enemy of the whole realm for you?

402
00:28:33,585 --> 00:28:35,385
His Majesty is not
doing this for me alone.

403
00:28:35,465 --> 00:28:38,145
He means to abolish the ban on our love,

404
00:28:39,345 --> 00:28:41,585
but also to cut away
Daning's rotten old laws.

405
00:28:42,305 --> 00:28:43,385
This road may be hard.

406
00:28:44,945 --> 00:28:45,785
But just because it is hard,

407
00:28:47,185 --> 00:28:48,425
should we simply give up?

408
00:28:49,665 --> 00:28:50,905
Your Majesty.

409
00:28:50,985 --> 00:28:53,425
These three ancestral laws
were decreed by our forebears.

410
00:28:53,505 --> 00:28:54,665
They cannot be defied.

411
00:28:54,745 --> 00:28:56,385
His Majesty sees farther than we do

412
00:28:56,465 --> 00:28:57,825
and is willing to set a new precedent.

413
00:28:57,905 --> 00:28:59,185
As his ministers,

414
00:28:59,265 --> 00:29:01,265
we should respectfully follow his lead.

415
00:29:03,705 --> 00:29:07,185
Look at the fine disciples
Grand Tutor Shen has taught.

416
00:29:07,265 --> 00:29:08,145
Every one of them

417
00:29:08,225 --> 00:29:10,465
relies on your backing

418
00:29:11,585 --> 00:29:14,625
and treats ancestral law like a game,

419
00:29:14,705 --> 00:29:16,905
joining His Majesty in this madness.

420
00:29:16,985 --> 00:29:17,825
Elder Xu.

421
00:29:18,345 --> 00:29:19,385
Rites change with the times,

422
00:29:19,465 --> 00:29:20,745
and laws must change with the age.

423
00:29:20,825 --> 00:29:23,345
Breaking with the old and creating the new
is the tide of the times.

424
00:29:23,425 --> 00:29:24,785
It takes a resolute sovereign

425
00:29:24,865 --> 00:29:26,425
to dare lead the way.

426
00:29:26,505 --> 00:29:28,625
Though you and I are old ministers,

427
00:29:28,705 --> 00:29:31,345
we must not become
defenders of the obsolete.

428
00:29:31,425 --> 00:29:32,985
The Grand Tutor speaks truly.

429
00:29:33,065 --> 00:29:34,665
What His Majesty said that day

430
00:29:34,745 --> 00:29:36,785
was a wake-up call to us all.

431
00:29:36,865 --> 00:29:39,305
And hearing the Grand Tutor today

432
00:29:39,385 --> 00:29:40,945
has helped those of us younger officials

433
00:29:41,465 --> 00:29:42,705
see the path clearly

434
00:29:42,785 --> 00:29:43,945
and has greatly inspired us.

435
00:29:44,745 --> 00:29:45,585
Exactly.

436
00:29:45,665 --> 00:29:47,225
We are willing to support His Majesty

437
00:29:47,305 --> 00:29:48,545
in sweeping away outdated laws

438
00:29:48,625 --> 00:29:49,705
and opening a new era.

439
00:29:49,785 --> 00:29:52,265
Have you not seen these three years
under His Majesty's rule?

440
00:29:52,945 --> 00:29:54,985
The court is full of new vitality,

441
00:29:55,065 --> 00:29:56,225
and Daning itself

442
00:29:56,985 --> 00:29:58,665
has been transformed.

443
00:30:05,065 --> 00:30:07,185
His Majesty arrives!

444
00:30:37,265 --> 00:30:40,465
Bring forth the Founding
Emperor's Punishment Whip!

445
00:31:01,265 --> 00:31:02,185
Your Majesty.

446
00:31:02,985 --> 00:31:04,945
The Founding Emperor's
Punishment Whip is here.

447
00:31:07,465 --> 00:31:09,385
But someone must carry out the punishment.

448
00:31:13,585 --> 00:31:14,705
Left Chancellor.

449
00:31:20,465 --> 00:31:21,345
Grand Tutor Shen.

450
00:31:22,225 --> 00:31:23,225
Ancestral law carries great weight,

451
00:31:23,985 --> 00:31:26,105
but His Majesty is the sovereign.

452
00:31:26,185 --> 00:31:28,305
His Majesty's health concerns
the fate of the realm.

453
00:31:28,385 --> 00:31:30,265
How could he be harmed in the slightest?

454
00:31:35,865 --> 00:31:36,825
Chief Steward You.

455
00:31:37,905 --> 00:31:38,745
You do it.

456
00:31:41,505 --> 00:31:43,145
This old servant would not dare.

457
00:31:43,225 --> 00:31:46,025
I am willing to take all seven lashes
in Your Majesty's place.

458
00:31:55,905 --> 00:31:57,105
Chief Steward You.

459
00:31:58,305 --> 00:32:00,385
You know how hard it was
for me to come this far.

460
00:32:03,185 --> 00:32:04,185
Help me this once.

461
00:33:00,025 --> 00:33:01,265
That lash does not count.

462
00:33:01,945 --> 00:33:02,785
Again.

463
00:33:02,865 --> 00:33:03,985
Your Majesty...

464
00:33:04,065 --> 00:33:04,945
Chief Steward You.

465
00:33:06,105 --> 00:33:07,345
You know how it must be done.

466
00:33:07,865 --> 00:33:09,505
The first lash must draw blood.

467
00:33:10,225 --> 00:33:11,465
The second must tear flesh.

468
00:33:12,105 --> 00:33:13,705
The third must jar the bone.

469
00:33:18,305 --> 00:33:20,545
This old servant deserves death.

470
00:33:26,905 --> 00:33:27,945
The first lash

471
00:33:29,785 --> 00:33:32,105
punishes me for defying
our ancestors' will

472
00:33:32,665 --> 00:33:34,985
and abolishing the ban
on sovereign-subject romance,

473
00:33:35,065 --> 00:33:36,385
permanent slave status,

474
00:33:37,305 --> 00:33:39,185
and the ministers'
nomination of the Empress—

475
00:33:39,265 --> 00:33:40,745
three ancestral laws.

476
00:33:47,265 --> 00:33:48,185
The second lash

477
00:33:49,545 --> 00:33:51,585
punishes me for defying the ministers

478
00:33:51,665 --> 00:33:53,425
and proclaiming my resolve to reform.

479
00:34:01,905 --> 00:34:03,065
Your Majesty!

480
00:34:03,145 --> 00:34:04,745
Imperial Physician Li, quickly...

481
00:34:16,105 --> 00:34:16,985
The third lash

482
00:34:18,345 --> 00:34:19,985
punishes me, the Son of Heaven,

483
00:34:21,025 --> 00:34:22,425
for issuing an Edict of Self-Reproach

484
00:34:23,745 --> 00:34:26,545
and subjecting this imperial
body to the pain of the whip

485
00:34:27,305 --> 00:34:29,705
to beg forgiveness
from the people of Daning.

486
00:34:29,785 --> 00:34:31,345
Continue.

487
00:35:18,705 --> 00:35:19,585
Your Majesty.

488
00:35:42,065 --> 00:35:43,745
My resolve is fixed.

489
00:35:43,825 --> 00:35:46,145
I also proclaim this
to every official at court:

490
00:35:46,225 --> 00:35:48,665
no matter how deep their seniority

491
00:35:48,745 --> 00:35:50,425
or how illustrious their achievements,

492
00:35:50,505 --> 00:35:52,025
whether palace rules and ancestral laws

493
00:35:52,105 --> 00:35:53,825
or old precedents of the dynasty,

494
00:35:53,905 --> 00:35:55,945
Daning's stability comes before all else.

495
00:35:56,625 --> 00:35:59,185
No one will ever again
use private interests

496
00:35:59,265 --> 00:36:00,865
to sway my decisions.

497
00:36:57,945 --> 00:36:59,185
From this day forward,

498
00:37:00,785 --> 00:37:02,625
the ban on sovereign-subject love,

499
00:37:03,025 --> 00:37:04,505
permanent slave status,

500
00:37:05,105 --> 00:37:07,465
and the ministers'
nomination of the Empress

501
00:37:07,545 --> 00:37:10,025
shall be removed forever
from Daning's ancestral laws.

502
00:37:41,905 --> 00:37:43,465
It is time to let the morning sun

503
00:37:45,185 --> 00:37:48,065
shine upon the fresh
snow before this hall.

504
00:38:00,305 --> 00:38:04,425
So the court can do without
this old minister after all.

505
00:38:30,025 --> 00:38:35,105
Long live His Majesty!
Long, long may he reign!

506
00:38:36,345 --> 00:38:41,505
Long live His Majesty!
Long, long may he reign!

507
00:38:42,905 --> 00:38:48,745
Long live His Majesty!
Long, long may he reign!

508
00:39:26,625 --> 00:39:27,745
For His Majesty,

509
00:39:27,825 --> 00:39:29,505
you knelt in the snow
for a full day and night.

510
00:39:29,585 --> 00:39:31,145
You truly risked everything.

511
00:39:31,705 --> 00:39:33,225
What if the cold leaves
lasting damage in your legs?

512
00:39:33,305 --> 00:39:34,185
What will you do then?

513
00:39:36,345 --> 00:39:38,105
What His Majesty endured

514
00:39:39,265 --> 00:39:40,705
was a thousand times
heavier than what I bore.

515
00:39:40,785 --> 00:39:42,745
His name as a wise ruler
must never be tarnished.

516
00:39:43,825 --> 00:39:46,145
History should remember him
as an enlightened ruler.

517
00:39:46,225 --> 00:39:47,825
Your feelings for each other run so deep.

518
00:39:48,625 --> 00:39:50,585
Now nothing can separate you.

519
00:39:53,305 --> 00:39:54,145
By the way,

520
00:39:55,225 --> 00:39:56,945
Fuzhi still has not written back.

521
00:39:58,585 --> 00:40:00,385
I wonder whether her father and stepmother

522
00:40:00,465 --> 00:40:01,865
have been giving her a hard time.

523
00:40:01,945 --> 00:40:03,385
Don't worry.

524
00:40:03,465 --> 00:40:04,625
With my brother there,

525
00:40:04,705 --> 00:40:06,225
Miss Yan will not be mistreated.

526
00:40:06,305 --> 00:40:08,625
A carefree young lord like him

527
00:40:08,705 --> 00:40:10,985
would actually settle down for one person.

528
00:40:11,545 --> 00:40:12,745
His Majesty is the same.

529
00:40:13,665 --> 00:40:15,225
Even if he must stand
against the whole realm,

530
00:40:15,305 --> 00:40:16,585
he will remain by your side.

531
00:40:18,025 --> 00:40:19,505
It is enough to make one envious.

532
00:40:19,585 --> 00:40:21,985
How are things between you and Anian?

533
00:40:25,225 --> 00:40:26,745
We have been together since childhood.

534
00:40:27,545 --> 00:40:29,025
Now, it is simply

535
00:40:29,625 --> 00:40:30,745
much the same as before.

536
00:40:32,305 --> 00:40:34,345
Do you feel even a little
affection for him now?

537
00:40:36,065 --> 00:40:37,665
If you have a good man beside you,

538
00:40:38,545 --> 00:40:40,385
perhaps you should give
each other a chance.

539
00:40:42,825 --> 00:40:44,025
He is such a good man.

540
00:40:46,065 --> 00:40:47,265
I keep feeling

541
00:40:48,105 --> 00:40:49,345
that I am holding him back.

542
00:40:49,425 --> 00:40:50,585
Mengmeng.

543
00:40:51,425 --> 00:40:52,545
Tell me.

544
00:40:52,625 --> 00:40:53,585
Why do you think I

545
00:40:53,665 --> 00:40:54,865
agreed to this marriage
in the first place?

546
00:40:54,945 --> 00:40:56,505
When pain becomes unbearable,

547
00:40:57,065 --> 00:40:58,665
we all need someone to lean on.

548
00:40:59,545 --> 00:41:00,825
Anian was the lamp in the fog

549
00:41:00,905 --> 00:41:02,665
that guided you forward.

550
00:41:02,745 --> 00:41:04,225
Because you know each other so well,

551
00:41:04,905 --> 00:41:06,785
he can give you the peace you need.

552
00:41:08,465 --> 00:41:10,065
But I do care about him.

553
00:41:10,145 --> 00:41:11,705
I cannot bear to see him hurt,

554
00:41:11,785 --> 00:41:13,585
much less see him unhappy because of me.

555
00:41:13,665 --> 00:41:14,905
You needn't feel guilty.

556
00:41:14,985 --> 00:41:17,625
I only hope you can
slowly lower your guard.

557
00:41:18,505 --> 00:41:19,825
Anian is worth it.

558
00:41:25,225 --> 00:41:27,225
Zhili. Director Meng.

559
00:41:30,985 --> 00:41:31,865
What brings you here?

560
00:41:32,465 --> 00:41:33,425
My patrol is finished.

561
00:41:33,505 --> 00:41:34,785
You were gone so long,

562
00:41:34,865 --> 00:41:35,945
I was worried about you.

563
00:41:36,865 --> 00:41:37,705
Zhili.

564
00:41:40,065 --> 00:41:40,905
Go on home.

565
00:41:44,505 --> 00:41:45,745
I bought the last basket of crab-roe buns

566
00:41:45,825 --> 00:41:46,865
from the shop on West Street.

567
00:41:46,945 --> 00:41:48,505
If we don't go now, they'll be cold.

568
00:41:51,065 --> 00:41:51,905
And one more thing.

569
00:41:52,705 --> 00:41:54,825
For tomorrow's return gifts,

570
00:41:55,305 --> 00:41:56,505
I followed Father and Mother's tastes

571
00:41:56,585 --> 00:41:57,825
and added several bolts of cloud brocade.

572
00:41:58,745 --> 00:42:00,585
See if that covers everything.

573
00:42:00,665 --> 00:42:01,865
It's so cold.

574
00:42:01,945 --> 00:42:03,385
Why come all this way?

575
00:42:03,465 --> 00:42:04,945
Because it is cold,

576
00:42:05,025 --> 00:42:06,185
That's exactly why I had to come.

577
00:42:09,385 --> 00:42:10,265
I'll be going.

